**`tasksCommand` greps `TODO.md` relative to CWD — fragile path assumption.**

If the bot is started from a directory other than the repo root, `grep -c '\\- \\[ \\]' TODO.md` will silently return `0` (via the `|| echo 0` fallback) and report no tasks. Consider resolving the path relative to a known root or making it configurable.

