path for the TODO file (e.g., resolve relative to the source/module root using
import.meta.dir or a configured tasksFile path) and pass that absolute path into
the Bun.spawn command instead of "TODO.md" (reference: tasksCommand, Bun.spawn,
the grep command string). Make the tasks file path configurable (env or options)
and update the error handling to surface path resolution failures before falling
back to "Could not read TODO.md".
```

</details>

